   "lines": [
    "Rowed to Loyds Neck,",
    "shooting through the",
    "marsh. At high tide",
    "it is good fun to",
    "paddle through the",
    "lagoons and among",
    "the winding channels,",
    "with an occasional",
    "shot at a heron or",
    "snipe. In the afternoon",
    "a strong southerly breeze",
    "came up, so I rigged",
    "my sail and went",
    "out three or four miles",
    "into the sound. Cuff[?]",
    "has left for a three weeks",
    "holiday"
   ],
   "rows": null,
